{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54464","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"量彼敌，将勇戒骄盈。\n整暇正须期死战，凯旋犹惧有骄（辛本、京本作「生」）兵，养气勿轻迎（辛本作「临」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}